diff --git a/docs/changelog.md b/docs/changelog.md
index cba971a..80cafb5 100644
--- a/docs/changelog.md
+++ b/docs/changelog.md
@@ -16,6 +16,10 @@ See the [Contributing Guide](contributing.md) for details.
 
 ### Fixed
 
+* Fix a `TypeError` crash in the `toc` extension when a heading has an `id`
+  attribute without a value, such as `{: id }` from `attr_list`. Such a heading,
+  and one with an empty `id`, now receives the auto-generated id like any other
+  heading.
 * Support automatic links with URL schemes other than HTTP and FTP, such as
   `<ssh://example.org>` (#1244).
 * Fix quadratic-time id generation in the `toc` extension when many headers
